ages/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9d532a32-75c8-4eb7-a198-f3e407e7c6a8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9d532a32-75c8-4eb7-a198-f3e407e7c6a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9d532a32-75c8-4eb7-a198-f3e407e7c6a8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Knights_of_the_Shield_Hideout#Hidden_Room\" title=\"Knights of the Shield Hideout\">Hidden Room</a> of the Knights of the Shield Hideout, on a bookshelf at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-746&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;585</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading the recipe elicits a response from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Ingredients\n</p><p>chopped fiddleheads\n</p><p>knob of butter\n</p><p>1 onion, chopped\n</p><p>1 clove of garlic, minced\n</p><p>1 tablespoon of flour\n</p><p>half a pan of chicken stock\n</p><p>assorted vegetables (potato, leek, carrot), chopped\n</p><p>heavy whipping cream\n</p><p>salt and pepper\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Melt the butter in a large pot over a hot fire. Do not burn. Stir in the onion and garlic until softened.\n</p><p>Add flour. Continue stirring.\n</p><p>Add chicken stock and bring to a boil. \n</p><p>Add fiddleheads and vegetables. Raise away from fire, simmer until vegetables are tender. \n</p><p>Stir in the cream, season, and serve.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1482/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26164/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7290/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930871/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.728      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.728      1 -total\n 50.53%   19.568      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.12%   17.088     15 Template:Trim\n 21.56%    8.348      2 Template:Uid\n 16.21%    6.278      1 Template:Main_only\n 15.11%    5.852      2 Template:Icon_link\n 11.38%    4.406      1 Template:N